HB0070 Irrigation districts-bid requirements.
Sponsored By: Joint Corporations, Elections & Political
Subdivisions Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to irrigation districts; increasing the cost requirements for
irrigation district purchases or projects that are required to be submitted for
bids; and providing for an effective date.
